stem:
Simplify the following expression completely and select all equivalent forms: $$
\left( \frac{4x^{-2}y^3}{12x^4y^{-1}} \right)^{-2}
$$

explanation_steps:
We start with the given system of linear equations:
$$\begin{aligned}
2x + y &= 7 \quad \text{(Equation 1)} \\
x - y &= 2 \quad \text{(Equation 2)}
\end{aligned}$$
